<div class="announcement-box" style="text-align:left;">
  <p class="announcement-heading">Online Courses</p>
  <p>Full details of all online programmes - including Qigong, Qigong Teacher Training, Yoga Teacher Training and Yin Yoga - are available on the dedicated <a href="/online-courses/">Online Courses</a> page.</p>
</div>





<p>Online classes and one-on-one sessions are available at flexible times. These are offered by Jenny, Seb, or both together depending on the session type. Please enquire to arrange a time that works for you.</p>





<div class="shared-story">
<p><strong>Jenny offers online:</strong> 200-hour and 500-hour Yoga Teacher Training courses with Restorative Yoga as a core element. She also offers Therapeutic Yoga, Restorative Yoga, Vinyasa Yoga, Hatha Yoga, Yin Yoga and other related classes.</p>
<p><strong>Seb offers online and in person:</strong> Qigong ranging from absolute beginner forms to highly precise advanced Shen practices, private one-on-one Qigong sessions with specific applications, and guidance on meditation.</p>
<p><strong>Jenny and Seb offer together online for worldwide audiences:</strong> Authentic Qigong training courses, 200-hour Qigong Teacher Training courses, selected modules within 200-hour and 500-hour Yoga Teacher Training courses, advanced energy work courses, and meditation sessions. These programmes draw on knowledge and skills that are rarely taught in mainstream settings and often not explored by other teachers at all - material that goes well beyond what is typically available in this space.</p>
</div>

<p>To book an online session, please get in touch through any of the channels on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>

